codex
Stage 4 passes the mechanical and source-identity gates: all available launcher hashes match (including all 803 frozen Stage 1 files), preflight succeeds with 10 obligations, and the generated theorem is the exact ordered conjunction with matching definition/statement/binding hashes. The obligations are materially relevant: zero handling, absolute-value normalization, and the two decimal-count recurrences in both orientations. I’m moving to the fresh Stage 5 build and semantic bridge checks.
