+# Audit command ledger
+
+This ledger lists the read-only verification and clean-build commands whose full
+captured outputs are stored alongside it. Mounted candidate and provenance files
+were inspected as untrusted evidence; no candidate-provided script was executed.
+

  ✓ Read the applicable K audit skills and launcher metadata
  ✓ Reconstruct and independently reclassify the Stage 3 rule inventory
  ✓ Verify producer provenance and rerun/audit deterministic Stage 4 generation
  ✓ Clean-build and audit the Stage 5 Lean proof, axioms, target, and bridges
  → Write the evidence ledger and self-contained final review
